{"id":"663700","name":"蒸豆腐脑","author":"美食家_XYDl_jjVM","authorId":"13134901","desc":"","cover":"images/663700/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐脑","amount":"自己做的"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆腐王","amount":"2克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买回来的豆浆在锅里煮熟。","img":"images/663700/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐王打开倒在碗里加凉水化开。","img":"images/663700/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"凉温后倒入豆浆里搅匀。","img":"images/663700/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐脑定型备用。","img":"images/663700/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里加水烧开放入豆腐脑。","img":"images/663700/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖子蒸上10分钟。","img":"images/663700/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"关火将豆腐脑儿凉一下。","img":"images/663700/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用勺子将它们分成小块。","img":"images/663700/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"香辣酱少许。","img":"images/663700/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放在豆腐脑上面。","img":"images/663700/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"在倒点醋调成汁就可以开吃了。","img":"images/663700/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/663700/step_12.jpeg"}],"tips":"料汁根据自己的囗味搭配。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}